== Print Sources

The condensed print source set. This is the ELSE branch, dropped when the edition is the ebook. Neither
this heading nor the paragraph below may appear in the rendered output; if either does, the assembler
followed both branches of the guard rather than only the taken one.

This paragraph exists solely so that a regression which rendered the untaken branch would add a whole
extra page of body text, moving the page count and the pinned hash unmistakably.
